<title>FRANCE: EU sets soft wheat flour export refund.</title>
<headline>EU sets soft wheat flour export refund.</headline>
<text>
<p>PARIS, Sept 19 (reuter) - The European Union on Thursday set a seven Ecus per tonne refund on daily exports of soft wheat flour, European grain traders said.</p>
<p>Until the decision, taken at weekly grain talks in Brussels, licences to export EU soft wheat flour carried a zero refund.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
